<p>The dam, projected to be similar to the future Big Bend Reservoir in South Dakota, suffered from controversy surrounding land use impacts, public-verses-government power-generation ratios and water-use rights with linked to the Garrison Dam project soon to begin construction. The costs verses positive impacts were not enough to get the project approved. Source: Big Dam Era; Missouri River Division Army Corps of Engineers</p>

<p>1952</p>

